.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt OPENSSL-ERRSTR 1ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm openssl-errstr
.Nd lookup error codes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm openssl errstr
.Oo
.Fl help ]
.Em error_code...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Sometimes an application will not load error message texts and only
numerical forms will be available.
This command can be used to display the meaning of the hex code.
The hex code is the hex digits after the second colon.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Sy -help
Display a usage message.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
The error code:
.Bd -literal
 27594:error:2006D080:lib(32)::reason(128)::107:
.Ed
.Pp
can be displayed with:
.Bd -literal
 openssl errstr 2006D080
.Ed
.Pp
to produce the error message:
.Bd -literal
 error:2006D080:BIO routines::no such file
.Ed
